    {
      "source": "Creates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <a href=\"../../sql/Column.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Column</code></a> instances by applying the provided mapping function to each\n<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> and <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a>，其中包含由提供的映射函数应用于每个<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>和<a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>后生成的<a href=\"../../sql/Column.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的类\"><code>Column</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Performs a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#reduce(U,java.util.function.BiFunction,java.util.function.BinaryOperator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream.reduce(Object, BiFunction, BinaryOperator)</code></a> on <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> to reduce the results into a single <code>T</code> return value.",
      "translation": "对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#reduce(U,java.util.function.BiFunction,java.util.function.BinaryOperator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream.reduce(Object, BiFunction, BinaryOperator)</code></a> 在 <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> 上执行，将结果缩减为单个 <code>T</code> 返回值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> for the provided <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>",
      "translation": "获取所提供<a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>的<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Calls the mapper for each pair one pair of <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> and <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>, if there is\nany.",
      "translation": "为每一对（如果存在）<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> 调用映射器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Any of the contained <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "所有包含的<a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the value of the <a href=\"../../../../../../../org/springframework/data/relational/core/mapping/AggregatePath.TableInfo.html#param-qualifierColumnInfo\"><code>qualifierColumnInfo</code></a> record component.",
      "translation": "返回<a href=\"../../../../../../../org/springframework/data/relational/core/mapping/AggregatePath.TableInfo.html#param-qualifierColumnInfo\"><code>qualifierColumnInfo</code></a>记录组件的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If this instance contains exactly one <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> it will be returned.",
      "translation": "如果该实例恰好包含一个<a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>，则将其返回。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Calls the consumer for each pair of <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> and ColumnInfo.",
      "translation": "为每个<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>和 ColumnInfo 对调用 Consumer。",
